    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest? i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen. i feel like i'm just taking up oxygen that someone actually useful could be using. how can you talk about \"just being\" when it feels like there's nothing even there to be? it's just a hollow shell.",
