      "content": "but it never passes. the weight just gets heavier. i look at my old work and i just see a stranger. it's like the light went out and there's no way to turn it back on. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the pressure, the only way to find real peace, is to just stop everything. to just let the void take over completely.",
